<title>UK: German inland gas oil firmer, good buying seen.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil firmer, good buying seen.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.7910)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     34.00/34.40     18.98/19.20   33.50/33.90</p>
<p> BREMEN		34.00/34.40     18.98/19.20   33.50/33.90</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    34.30/34.70     19.15/19.38   33.70/34.10</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   35.00/35.40     19.54/19.76   34.40/34.80</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   35.10/35.50     19.60/19.82   34.50/34.90</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  36.80/37.20     20.55/20.77   36.20/36.60</p>
<p>German inland gas oil prices were firmer in line with gains in the key Rotterdam market and with trader reporting some good buying interest from end-users. They said the stronger dollar was encouraging buyers to take more local product rather than import.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
